    {
      "kind": "wordplay",
      "subject": "אמר אמר",
      "rationale": "Poeletlo ya go re go gatelela (\"ka moo ke re\") — sebopego sa Seheberu seo se laelago tlhaho, se hwetšwa ka 'ka moo'."
